.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt VM_STAT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vm_stat
.Nd show virtual memory statistics
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Oo Fl c Ar count Oc Ar interval
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints virtual memory statistics from the kernel.
With an
.Ar interval
in seconds, it prints them repeatedly.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl c Ar count
Stop after this many samples.
.El
